  "body": "Someone pointed out that one of the images in the spec had a transparent background but used black text, so it wasn't very visible. I went thru all the SVG images used by the spec, and made them all darkmode-aware, so they look nice now.\n\nI'm also tagging all of these images with the class \"darkmode-aware\"; I'm going to accompany this with a PR to the WHATWG stylesheets that puts a white background on all SVG images that don't have that class. But that doesn't block this  PR; the rule won't hit any of the images in HTML. So feel free to merge this ahead of time.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10257/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 5, 2024, 10:22 PM UTC (293bdfc)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10257/702119c...293bdfc/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 5, 2024, 10:22 PM UTC (293bdfc)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10257/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 5, 2024, 10:22 PM UTC (293bdfc)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10257/702119c...293bdfc/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 5, 2024, 10:22 PM UTC (293bdfc)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10257/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 5, 2024, 10:22 PM UTC (293bdfc)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10257/702119c...293bdfc/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 5, 2024, 10:22 PM UTC (293bdfc)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10257/canva